<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <body style="font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: #111">
    <p>Hello,</p>
    <p><strong>{{proposerName}}</strong> proposes to {{#if isAdd}}add {{subjectNames}} as owner(s){{/if}}{{#if isRemove}}remove {{subjectNames}} as owner{{#if demoteTo}} (they keep the role {{demoteTo}}){{else}} (they leave the organization){{/if}}{{/if}} in <strong>{{organizationName}}</strong> on <strong>{{appName}}</strong>.</p>
    <p>{{#if reason}}Reason: {{reason}}{{/if}}</p>
    <p>Nothing happens until every other owner agrees. Please answer before {{expiresAt}}.</p>
    <p><a href="{{manageUrl}}" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #0b57d0; color: #fff; border-radius: 6px; text-decoration: none">Review the proposal</a></p>
    <p style="font-size: 0.875rem; color: #444">{{manageUrl}}</p>
  </body>
</html>
